@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Đăng nhập";
}
@*
    Man DANG NHAP cua co so dung bo man doi tac (Ung Buou).

    Khuon lay NGUYEN VAN tu repo doi tac:
      DangKyOnlineUB/PhongMach/Views/HT_DangNhap/Login.cshtml  (style 1-491, markup 581-686)
    Chi doi 4 cho: logo, bo cuc mot cot cho dien thoai, hai lien ket noi bo,
    va khoi <script> goi API cua SixosPwa thay vi cua ho.

    Doc ADR 0014 truoc khi sua. KHONG "don cho gon" markup — giu giong ho la co y.
*@

<!doctype html>
<html lang="vi">
